  "text": "24 Hour Emergency Vet | Veterinary Specialty Hospital - San Diego\nSkip to Primary Content\n24/7 Emergency Care\n24/7 Emergency Care\nEthos Hospitals\nBlood Donor Registration Form\nAbout Us\nOur Hospital\nOur Team\nContact Us\nEthos Discovery\nServices\nAnesthesia and Pain Management\nBlood Bank\nDermatology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nEmergency/Critical Care\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSocial Work\nSurgery\nFor Your Pet\nPet Resources\nEmergencies + Appointments\nClient Portal\nWhen Your Pet is a Patient\nOnline Food Ordering\nGrief Resources & Pet Loss Support\nPet Insurance\nPayment Options\nBlog\nOnline Forms\nClient Registration Form\nFormulario de Registro de Nuevo Cliente\nPrescription Refill Form\nBlood Donor Consent Form\nFor Veterinary Teams\nContinuing Education\nSubmit Referrals\nOur Referral Process\nEthos Materials for Clinics\nVetBloom CE\nCareers\nSearch for DVM opportunities\nSearch for non-DVM opportunities\nPositions Across Ethos\nBenefits and Perks\n24/7 Emergency Care\nSpecialty + 24/7 Emergency Care\nLearn More\nProudly Serving Pets and Their Families Since 1990\nAbout Us\nSpecialty + 24/7 Emergency Care\nLearn More\nProudly Serving Pets and Their Families Since 1990\nAbout Us\nSpecialty + 24/7 Emergency Care\nLearn More\nWelcome to Veterinary Specialty Hospital\nProviding Emergency & Specialty Veterinary Care in San Diego\nThe Veterinary Specialty Hospital of San Diego brings a positive impact to the lives of beloved pets and their devoted owners. Since 1990, we have stood as a 24-hour emergency and specialty animal hospital in the San Diego area. Our distinguished specialists offer veterinary specialty and emergency care to Sorrento Valley, San Diego, La Jolla, and the surrounding areas, leveraging cutting-edge technology to ensure top-tier veterinary support.\nAbout Us\nWe're Hiring!\nClient Registration Form\nClient Portal\nReferral Forms\nWe're Hiring!\nClient Registration Form\nClient Portal\nReferral Forms\nWe're Hiring!\nClient Registration Form\nClient Portal\nReferral Forms\nWe're Hiring!\nHighlights of Diagnostic and Therapeutic Options\nPlease contact us if you are seeking a service or treatment not listed here\nCT\nMRI\nFluoroscopy\nDigital Radiography\nUltrasound:\nAbdomen, Cardiac, Thoracic, Musculoskeletal\nVideo Scoping:\nCystoscopy, Endoscopy, Rhinoscopy, and more\nMinimally Invasive Surgery:\nArthroscopy, Laparoscopy, Thoracoscopy\nOphthalmic Diode Laser System\nPhacoemulsification surgery\nOperating Microscope\nTransfusion Medicine\nMechanical Ventilator\nElectromyography (EMG)\nEchocardiogram & Electrocardiogram (ECG)\nSpinal Tap\nWe are an AAHA Certified Hospital\nThe American Animal Hospital Association (AAHA) is the only organization that accredits veterinary practices in the United States and Canada. Practices that accept the challenge of accreditation are evaluated on stringent quality standards that encompass all aspects of veterinary medicine—from pain management and patient care to team training and medical record keeping.\nContact Us\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(858) 875-7500\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nVeterinary Specialty Hospital - Sorrento Valley\n10435 Sorrento Valley Rd\nSorrento Valley\n,\nCA\n92121\nT:\n(858) 875-7500\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nClient Portal\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
